      "text": "同宮有火星或鈴星，自置豐厚，只是房子總有破損，古人說「火貪宜住舊宅華廈」。",
      "en": "With Huo Xing or Ling Xing in the palace, you acquire plenty, though the house always has some wear; the old saying is that this suits a grand old home.",
